# Workspace-local secrets / host config, read by `cargo xtask …`.
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in. The process environment always
# wins over `.env`, so `export KEY=…` overrides a value here.

# --- Bare-metal test host (cargo xtask metal) ---------------------------
# The Cloud-Hypervisor microVM `kvm-tests` need x86_64 + nested KVM, which
# Lima on Apple Silicon cannot provide, so their Tier-3 boot surface runs on
# a real x86_64 box reached over ssh. `cargo xtask metal run` reads this.
# Format: user@host.
OVERDRIVE_METAL_TARGET=ubuntu@1.2.3.4

# --- MCP setup (cargo xtask mcp setup) ----------------------------------
# Materialised into `.mcp.json`; Claude Code does not expand env vars there.
# GITHUB_PAT=github_pat_...
# GREPTILE_API_KEY=...
